---
---
<section class="py-24 bg-slate-900 text-white overflow-hidden relative">
  {/* Decorative bg */}
  <div class="absolute top-0 right-0 w-1/2 h-full bg-gradient-to-bl from-primary/20 to-transparent opacity-50 blur-3xl pointer-events-none"></div>
  <div class="absolute bottom-0 left-0 w-1/2 h-full bg-gradient-to-tr from-accent/10 to-transparent opacity-50 blur-3xl pointer-events-none"></div>
  
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 relative z-10">
    <div class="text-center mb-16">
      <span class="text-accent font-semibold tracking-wider uppercase text-sm mb-2 block">Proses Mudah & Cepat</span>
      <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-bold mb-6">Alur Pemesanan B2B</h2>
      <p class="text-lg text-slate-300 max-w-2xl mx-auto">Kami merancang alur kerja yang transparan, mudah, dan profesional untuk menjamin hasil terbaik bagi seragam Anda.</p>
    </div>
    
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-8 relative">
      {/* Connecting line (desktop) */}
      <div class="hidden lg:block absolute top-12 left-1/8 right-1/8 h-0.5 bg-slate-800 z-0">
        <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-r from-primary to-accent opacity-50"></div>
      </div>
      
      {/* Step 1 */}
      <div class="relative z-10 bg-slate-800/50 backdrop-blur-sm rounded-2xl p-8 border border-slate-700 hover:border-primary transition-colors">
        <div class="w-16 h-16 bg-slate-900 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-xl font-bold text-accent border-2 border-slate-700 mx-auto mb-6 shadow-lg shadow-slate-900/50">
          01
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-3 text-center">Konsultasi & Brief</h3>
        <p class="text-slate-400 text-center text-sm leading-relaxed">Hubungi admin kami. Diskusikan jenis pakaian, bahan yang diinginkan, jumlah, dan deadline kebutuhan Anda.</p>
      </div>
      
      {/* Step 2 */}
      <div class="relative z-10 bg-slate-800/50 backdrop-blur-sm rounded-2xl p-8 border border-slate-700 hover:border-primary transition-colors">
        <div class="w-16 h-16 bg-slate-900 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-xl font-bold text-accent border-2 border-slate-700 mx-auto mb-6 shadow-lg shadow-slate-900/50">
          02
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-3 text-center">Mockup & Penawaran</h3>
        <p class="text-slate-400 text-center text-sm leading-relaxed">Kami buatkan desain digital (mockup) beserta dokumen Surat Penawaran Harga (Quotation) resmi untuk perusahaan.</p>
      </div>
      
      {/* Step 3 */}
      <div class="relative z-10 bg-slate-800/50 backdrop-blur-sm rounded-2xl p-8 border border-slate-700 hover:border-primary transition-colors">
        <div class="w-16 h-16 bg-slate-900 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-xl font-bold text-accent border-2 border-slate-700 mx-auto mb-6 shadow-lg shadow-slate-900/50">
          03
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-3 text-center">Pembayaran DP & Sampel</h3>
        <p class="text-slate-400 text-center text-sm leading-relaxed">Setelah pembayaran DP (Down Payment), kami membuat 1 buah sampel fisik (untuk order jumlah tertentu) sebelum produksi massal.</p>
      </div>
      
      {/* Step 4 */}
      <div class="relative z-10 bg-slate-800/50 backdrop-blur-sm rounded-2xl p-8 border border-slate-700 hover:border-primary transition-colors">
        <div class="w-16 h-16 bg-slate-900 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-xl font-bold text-accent border-2 border-slate-700 mx-auto mb-6 shadow-lg shadow-slate-900/50">
          04
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-3 text-center">Produksi & Pengiriman</h3>
        <p class="text-slate-400 text-center text-sm leading-relaxed">Produksi massal dijalankan sesuai timeline. Setelah pelunasan, pesanan dikirim via kurir instan/cargo ke alamat Anda.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    
    <div class="mt-16 text-center">
      <a href="#contact" class="btn btn-primary btn-lg shadow-lg shadow-primary/30 text-white rounded-full px-10">Mulai Konsultasi Sekarang</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
